  - name: EU ETS Directive 2003/87/EC and German Fuel Emissions Trading Act 
      (BEHG)
    authority: European Union; Federal Republic of Germany
    url: https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/dir/2003/87/oj
    description: 'Scope of the EU emissions trading system for power, heat, industry
      and aviation (EU ETS1, since 2005; aviation since 2012), of the emissions trading
      system for buildings and road transport (EU ETS2, chapter IVa, inserted by Directive
      (EU) 2023/959; start postponed from 2027 to 2028 by the agreement of 5 November
      2025), and of the German Brennstoffemissionshandelsgesetz (BEHG): fixed prices
      2021-2025 (25, 30, 30, 45, 55 EUR/t), price corridor 55-65 EUR/t in 2026-2027.;
      Format: Legal text; Licensing: Public; Geographic Coverage: EU / Germany; Update
      Frequency: On amendment; Date Last Updated: 2026-10-07; Updated by: Kausal'
    edition:
    target: data_point
  - name: Kausal assignment of BISKO energy carriers to emissions trading 
      systems
    authority: Kausal Ltd
    url:
    description: 'Which trading system covers the emissions of each BISKO sector and
      energy carrier by year. Assigns to a cap whatever could plausibly be called
      capped (industrial fuels and district heating to EU ETS1, upstream emissions
      with their carrier), so the assignment grants the waterbed objection rather
      than understating it. Made by modules/fair-share/scripts/create_objections_data.py.;
      Geographic Coverage: Germany; Update Frequency: On rebuild; Date Last Updated:
      2026-10-07; Updated by: Kausal'
    edition:
    target: data_point
